<title>USA: Outdoor Systems Inc Q4 shr $0.04 vs $0.06.</title>
<headline>Outdoor Systems Inc Q4 shr $0.04 vs $0.06.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr   profit    $0.04	   profit $0.06</p>
<p> Net   profit    1,634	   profit 2,209</p>
<p> Revs		94,820		   18,189</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  45,342		   25,424</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr    loss     $0.19	    profit$0.01</p>
<p> Net    loss     3,443	    profit2,768</p>
<p> Revs		173,116		  64,813</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  35,263		   25,424</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: The acquisition of Gannett Outdoor in August 1996 contributed about $74 million to net revenues and about $26 million to an increase in operating cash flow for the fourth quarter 1996.</p>
<p>Q4 1996 includes an extraordinary loss of $0.10 a share. Income before the loss was $0.14 a share. Full year 1996 includes an extraordinary loss of $0.50 a share. Income before the loss was $0.31 a share.</p>
